---
// Layout exclusivo del panel de control de la liga (/admin)
// Directivas: no-store, CSP estricta, español neutro, nav móvil con touch targets >= 4.25rem (68px).
import '../styles/global.css';

interface Props {
  title?: string;
  seccionActiva?: 'resumen' | 'fixture' | 'importar';
}

const { title = 'Panel de Control', seccionActiva = 'resumen' } = Astro.props;
const tituloFinal = `${title} · Panel LBC`;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="h-full bg-navy-950 text-paper">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{tituloFinal}</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo-lbc-bgr.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="flex min-h-dvh flex-col bg-navy-950 font-display pb-24 md:pb-8">
    <!-- Header institucional del panel -->
    <header class="border-b border-navy-700 bg-navy-900/90 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-40">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1200px] items-center justify-between px-4 py-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <a href="/admin" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 focus:outline-none">
            <img src="/logo-lbc-bgr.png" alt="LBC" class="h-9 w-9 object-contain" />
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-paper">LBC · PANEL</span>
                <span id="badge-rol" class="rounded bg-navy-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400 border border-navy-700">
                  Verificando...
                </span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[0.7rem] text-paper-muted">Secretaría de la Liga</p>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Navegación desktop -->
        <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium">
          <a
            href="/admin"
            class:list={[
              'rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 transition-colors',
              seccionActiva === 'resumen'
                ? 'bg-orange-500 font-bold text-ink'
                : 'text-paper hover:bg-navy-800',
            ]}
          >
            Resumen
          </a>
          <a
            href="/admin/fixture"
            class:list={[
              'rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 transition-colors',
              seccionActiva === 'fixture'
                ? 'bg-orange-500 font-bold text-ink'
                : 'text-paper hover:bg-navy-800',
            ]}
          >
            Fixture
          </a>
          <a
            href="/admin/fixture/importar"
            class:list={[
              'rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 transition-colors',
              seccionActiva === 'importar'
                ? 'bg-orange-500 font-bold text-ink'
                : 'text-paper hover:bg-navy-800',
            ]}
          >
            Pegar Excel
          </a>
        </nav>

        <!-- Acciones de sesión -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <button
            id="btn-aviso-sitio-publico"
            type="button"
            class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-navy-700 bg-navy-800 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-paper-muted hover:text-paper hover:border-navy-600 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
            Sitio público
          </button>

          <button
            id="btn-cerrar-sesion"
            type="button"
            class="rounded-lg border border-red-500/40 bg-red-500/10 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-red-400 hover:bg-red-500 hover:text-paper transition-colors"
          >
            Salir
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Estado de carga mientras verifica sesión -->
    <div id="admin-cargando" class="flex flex-1 items-center justify-center p-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center">
        <div class="h-8 w-8 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-navy-700 border-t-orange-500"></div>
        <p class="text-sm text-paper-muted">Comprobando permisos de secretaría...</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contenedor principal (oculto hasta confirmar auth) -->
    <main id="admin-contenido" class="hidden mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] flex-1 px-4 py-6">
      <slot />
    </main>

    <!-- Cinta de navegación móvil inferior (Docs/05 §5 y Docs/10 §3: ítems >= 4.25rem = 68px de alto) -->
    <nav
      id="nav-cinta-movil"
      class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-40 flex h-[68px] items-stretch border-t border-navy-700 bg-navy-900/95 backdrop-blur md:hidden"
    >
      <a
        href="/admin"
        class:list={[
          'flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center transition-colors',
          seccionActiva === 'resumen' ? 'text-orange-500 font-bold' : 'text-paper-muted hover:text-paper',
        ]}
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect width="7" height="9" x="3" y="3" rx="1"></rect>
          <rect width="7" height="5" x="14" y="3" rx="1"></rect>
          <rect width="7" height="9" x="14" y="12" rx="1"></rect>
          <rect width="7" height="5" x="3" y="16" rx="1"></rect>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider">Resumen</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/admin/fixture"
        class:list={[
          'flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center transition-colors',
          seccionActiva === 'fixture' ? 'text-orange-500 font-bold' : 'text-paper-muted hover:text-paper',
        ]}
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider">Fixture</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/admin/fixture/importar"
        class:list={[
          'flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center transition-colors',
          seccionActiva === 'importar' ? 'text-orange-500 font-bold' : 'text-paper-muted hover:text-paper',
        ]}
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
          <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
          <line x1="12" y1="18" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
          <line x1="9" y1="15" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider">Importar</span>
      </a>

      <button
        id="btn-movil-sitio"
        type="button"
        class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-center text-paper-muted hover:text-paper transition-colors"
      >
        <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
          <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
          <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
        </svg>
        <span class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-wider">Público</span>
      </button>
    </nav>

    <!-- Diálogo modal de confirmación destructiva/sensible (Docs/05 §2: CSP-safe, data-confirm) -->
    <dialog
      id="dialogo-confirmacion"
      class="fixed inset-0 m-auto rounded-xl border border-navy-700 bg-navy-900 p-6 text-paper shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-navy-950/80 max-w-md w-[90%]"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 text-orange-500">
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"></path>
              <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"></line>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-paper">Confirmar acción</h3>
            <p id="dialogo-confirmacion-texto" class="mt-1 text-sm text-paper-muted">
              ¿Está seguro de que desea continuar?
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex justify-end gap-2">
          <button
            id="dialogo-confirmacion-cancelar"
            type="button"
            class="rounded-lg border border-navy-700 bg-navy-800 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-paper hover:bg-navy-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Cancelar
          </button>
          <button
            id="dialogo-confirmacion-aceptar"
            type="button"
            class="rounded-lg bg-orange-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink hover:bg-orange-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Confirmar
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <!-- Diálogo modal para advertir salida al sitio público -->
    <dialog
      id="dialogo-salida-publico"
      class="fixed inset-0 m-auto rounded-xl border border-navy-700 bg-navy-900 p-6 text-paper shadow-2xl backdrop:bg-navy-950/80 max-w-md w-[90%]"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-paper">Pasar al sitio público</h3>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-paper-muted">
            Está a punto de salir del panel de administración para visualizar el sitio como lo ven los hinchas. Podrá regresar en cualquier momento navegando a <code class="text-orange-500">/admin</code>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex justify-end gap-2">
          <button
            id="dialogo-salida-cancelar"
            type="button"
            class="rounded-lg border border-navy-700 bg-navy-800 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-paper hover:bg-navy-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Quedarme en el panel
          </button>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink hover:bg-orange-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Ir al sitio público
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </dialog>
  </body>
</html>

<script>
  import { obtenerEstadoAdmin, cerrarSesion } from '../lib/supabase-browser';

  async function inicializarAdmin() {
    const estado = await obtenerEstadoAdmin();

    const cargando = document.getElementById('admin-cargando');
    const contenido = document.getElementById('admin-contenido');
    const badgeRol = document.getElementById('badge-rol');

    if (!estado.autenticado) {
      const redirect = encodeURIComponent(window.location.pathname + window.location.search);
      window.location.href = `/admin/login?redirect=${redirect}`;
      return;
    }

    if (!estado.esOrganizador) {
      if (cargando) {
        cargando.innerHTML = `
          <div class="max-w-md rounded-xl border border-navy-700 bg-navy-900 p-6 text-center">
            <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-paper">Acceso restringido</h2>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-paper-muted">
              Su cuenta tiene rol <strong>${estado.rol ?? 'invitado'}</strong>. El portal para delegados de clubes se habilitará en la siguiente fase (IT5).
            </p>
            <button id="btn-cerrar-restringido" class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-orange-500 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-ink">
              Cerrar sesión
            </button>
          </div>
        `;
        document.getElementById('btn-cerrar-restringido')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
          await cerrarSesion();
          window.location.href = '/admin/login';
        });
      }
      return;
    }

    // Usuario autenticado y con rol de secretaría
    if (badgeRol) {
      if (estado.isSuperadmin) {
        badgeRol.textContent = 'SUPERADMIN';
        badgeRol.className = 'rounded bg-orange-500/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-500 border border-orange-500/30';
      } else if (estado.rol === 'liga_admin') {
        badgeRol.textContent = 'LIGA ADMIN';
        badgeRol.className = 'rounded bg-gold-400/20 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400 border border-gold-400/30';
      } else {
        badgeRol.textContent = 'AYUDANTE';
        badgeRol.className = 'rounded bg-navy-800 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-paper-muted border border-navy-700';
      }
    }

    if (cargando) cargando.classList.add('hidden');
    if (contenido) contenido.classList.remove('hidden');

    // Despachar evento para que los componentes de página sepan que el usuario está listo
    window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('admin-auth-ok', { detail: estado }));
  }

  // Event listener para cerrar sesión
  document.getElementById('btn-cerrar-sesion')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    await cerrarSesion();
    window.location.href = '/admin/login';
  });

  // Modal para salir al sitio público
  const dialogoSalida = document.getElementById('dialogo-salida-publico') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
  const abrirSalida = () => dialogoSalida?.showModal();
  document.getElementById('btn-aviso-sitio-publico')?.addEventListener('click', abrirSalida);
  document.getElementById('btn-movil-sitio')?.addEventListener('click', abrirSalida);
  document.getElementById('dialogo-salida-cancelar')?.addEventListener('click', () => dialogoSalida?.close());

  // Manejo global y CSP-safe de confirmaciones destructivas con [data-confirm]
  const dialogoConfirm = document.getElementById('dialogo-confirmacion') as HTMLDialogElement | null;
  const textoConfirm = document.getElementById('dialogo-confirmacion-texto');
  const btnAceptarConfirm = document.getElementById('dialogo-confirmacion-aceptar');
  const btnCancelarConfirm = document.getElementById('dialogo-confirmacion-cancelar');

  btnCancelarConfirm?.addEventListener('click', () => dialogoConfirm?.close());

  document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    const el = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('[data-confirm]') as HTMLElement | null;
    if (!el) return;

    const mensaje = el.getAttribute('data-confirm');
    if (!mensaje) return;

    e.preventDefault();
    e.stopPropagation();

    if (dialogoConfirm && textoConfirm && btnAceptarConfirm) {
      textoConfirm.textContent = mensaje;
      dialogoConfirm.showModal();

      const onConfirm = () => {
        dialogoConfirm.close();
        btnAceptarConfirm.removeEventListener('click', onConfirm);

        // Si es un botón submit de formulario, despachar submit
        const form = el.closest('form');
        if (el.getAttribute('type') === 'submit' && form) {
          form.requestSubmit(el);
        } else {
          el.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('confirmado', { bubbles: true }));
        }
      };

      btnAceptarConfirm.addEventListener('click', onConfirm, { once: true });
    }
  });

  inicializarAdmin();
</script>
